    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "List of ingredients",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Glycerin, Aqua\/Water, Sorbitol, Hydrated Silica, Xylitol, Polysorbate 80, Cellulose Gum, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil, Phenoxyethanol, Sucralose, Tetrasodium Pyrophosphate,CI17200\/D&C Red No.33,CI42090\/FD&C Blue No.1, Ethylhexylglycerin.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Apply 2 pumps to a soft bristle toothbrush.<br\/><br\/>2. Gently brush in a circular motion for 2 minutes.<br\/><br\/>3. Expel excess and rinse mouth after use.<br\/><br\/>4. Instantly see the shade of your teeth improve.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When should I use V34 Colour Corrector?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>V34 is recommended to be used as a post  brushing treatment, however it can be used on its own daily or before an event, to eliminate unwanted yellow undertones on your teeth.<\/p><p><strong>Recommended usage time<\/strong>: 3 times a week - please note there is no harm using the V34 daily.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does the V34 whiten my teeth?",
            "icon": "heart",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ V34 Colour Corrector utilises colour-correcting technology. Purple is directly opposite yellow on the colour wheel and is therefore its complementary colour, so a water-soluble purple dye is applied to help neutralise yellow undertones on your teeth.<br\/><br\/>✔ While oxidising agents like PAP+ aim to increase brightness by reducing yellow saturation, V34 instead balances warm and cool tones (hue) in your smile to reveal a more vibrant appearance.<br\/><br\/>✔ Contains mineral-based ingredients, which help maintain comfort during use and support a refreshed feel.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warnings",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Do not swallow the colour corrector, if swallowed in small quantities do not worry.<br\/><\/li><li>Do not let the colour corrector get near your eyes, rub water if V34 gets into contact with or near eyes.<br\/><\/li><li>Recommended for ages 12 and above. Not recommended for children.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_iiXMke": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the V34 Colour Corrector be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the V34 Colour Corrector is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. This product is designed to enhance the brightness of your smile by neutralising yellow tones without altering the colour of dental restorations. It is gentle on all dental materials, ensuring that your composite bonding, veneers, and fillings remain unaffected while your natural teeth appear visibly brighter.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
